{"lyrics":"[00:02.24](What?)\n[00:02.38]I don't know, I just wanted to hear your voice\n[00:04.42](Okay, look at him)\n[00:06.78]Cute dog\n[00:12.36](Purps On The Beat)\n[00:13.10]She got dogs and shit in the background, mute yo' self\n[00:17.96]I tell her \"na-na-na-na-na-na\"\n[00:21.00]I tell her, \"Ah-na-ah-na-ah-na\"\n[00:23.68]Her voice sounds like a stereo, and it's up in my head, when she is not around, it feels like I'ma turn up dead\n[00:29.80]I'm calling on her phone, telling her I'm full of dread, I wish that she was here, playing in my dreads\n[00:35.76]She told me she really likes me, I hope it's not a fib, I told myself I wouldn't go through the same shit again\n[00:41.80]She runnin', runnin' through my head like a race, she tryna win but she don't know that she don't got no competition\n[00:48.14]I'm in Paris by myself, it feel like something's missin', ex-girl on my phone, bitch, why is you trippin'?\n[00:54.22]Leave me alone, I done moved on to somethin' different, I'm finally gettin' the feeling I was missin'\n[01:02.10]Uh, you came in like a hurricane, you tell me you ain't playin' at all, I'm still tryna figure out the games\n[01:07.72]Maybe there ain't no games to play in the first place, maybe you a real one, we gon' see\n[01:14.30]Oh, and me? I'm real as can be, I want to eat your heart out, figuratively\n[01:19.46]I've been feelin' different since you've been away from me, I'm tempted to get too high\n[01:26.78]And me? I'm real as can be, I'm tryna eat your soul out physically\n[01:31.86]Ain't scared to bring them poles out, you know how I roll out but I got a soft spot for the girl that makes my heart drop\n[01:39.04]Uh, poles out, you know how I roll out, yeah, I got a soft spot for the girl that makes my heart drop\n[01:45.20]I'll go all out, yeah, I'll go all out, I'll go all out, yeah, I'll go all out\n[01:51.50]Gucci on your wrist, you ain't think I've seen it, I wish you was here, everything is scenic\n[01:57.30]Having chest pains, feelin' like I'm endin', this is real life, I am not pretendin'\n[02:03.46]Cupid got a gun at my head, finna pull it, I'ma stand here and take it, ain't dodgin' bullets\n[02:09.26]This seems too good be to true, what's to it? You told me that it ain't nothin' to it, but to do it\n[02:15.86]Uh, so I'ma do that motherfucker if they try you, uh\n[02:19.66]I'ma shoot a motherfucker, I love your vibes, ooh\n[02:22.72]I'ma do that motherfucker when I lay beside, ooh, you know I wanna fuck her\n[02:27.48]My homie asked, \"What's next? Do I like her, do I love her, do I want her?\" I wonder if I give her my heart, am I a goner?\n[02:33.44]She keep Backwoods rolled, she a stoner, she a stoner, tattoos on her face, I kiss her ink under covers\n[02:39.74]Uh, get my tongue involved, she got me in awe, baby, give me it all, uh, feel it through my draws, baby\n[02:46.24]All night long, you deserve an applause, baby, made me a better person already, I didn't involve, baby\n[02:52.36]Tell me why my old ho's still tryna be involved, baby, I feel like you should load it up and shoot 'em in the jaw, baby\n[02:58.60]I was off the Xannies, calling your phone, feeling wrong, baby, prolly 'cause you told me leave the Xannies alone, baby\n[03:05.08]Uh, so I'ma do that motherfucker if they try you, uh\n[03:08.88]I'ma shoot a motherfucker, I love your vibes, ooh\n[03:17.96]I'ma do that motherfucker when I lay beside, ooh, you know I wanna fuck her\n[03:30.26]Uh, so I'ma do that motherfucker if they try you, uh\n[03:34.50]I'ma shoot a motherfucker, I love your vibes, ooh\n[03:37.58]I'ma do that motherfucker when I lay beside, ooh, you know I wanna fuck her","words":[[2.24,2.32,"(What?)"],[2.38,2.38,"I"],[3.36,3.52,"don't"],[3.56,3.62,"know,"],[3.66,3.66,"I"],[3.7,3.78,"just"],[3.84,3.96,"wanted"],[4.0,4.02,"to"],[4.06,4.12,"hear"],[4.16,4.22,"your"],[4.26,4.38,"voice"],[4.42,4.52,"(Okay,"],[5.32,6.54,"look"],[6.58,6.66,"at"],[6.7,6.74,"him)"],[6.78,6.84,"Cute"],[6.88,6.92,"dog"],[12.36,12.58,"(